; Run-Shaders - the game's GLSL programs compiled with the package's ogles2
; (libs/: ogles2.library and v3dglslc), into results/shaders/ for the
; release's release/shaders (after an ogles2 or compiler update).
;   Execute Run-Shaders                     (LIBS:v3dglslc already the one)
;   Execute Run-Shaders INSTALL=1 KEEP=v3dglslc.beta1
; ogles2.library takes the compiler in LIBS: before the program's libs/, so
; LIBS:v3dglslc must be the package's: INSTALL=1 (a system file: the
; developer asks for it) renames LIBS:v3dglslc to LIBS:<KEEP> (unless that
; exists) and copies libs/v3dglslc into LIBS:. The game's records are named by
; their sources' hash, not by the compiler, so the old ones in T: (or
; OGLES2Cache:) would be loaded again: they are deleted first, and the
; library flushed (its compiler stays resident until then). The game then
; starts the free demo's timedemo (all of its programs are made at start-up)
; with no shaders/ drawer here, and the records it wrote are copied.
.key DATA,INSTALL,KEEP
.def DATA "Stuff:doom3"
.def INSTALL 0
.def KEEP "v3dglslc.old"
.bra {
.ket }

FailAt 21
MakeDir results results/shaders >NIL:
If {INSTALL} EQ 1
  If NOT EXISTS LIBS:{KEEP}
    Rename LIBS:v3dglslc LIBS:{KEEP}
  EndIf
  Copy libs/v3dglslc LIBS:v3dglslc CLONE
EndIf
List LIBS:v3dglslc#? libs >results/libs.txt
Version LIBS:ogles2.library FULL >>results/libs.txt
Version libs/ogles2.library FULL >>results/libs.txt

; the records of earlier compiles: T: holds them when OGLES2Cache: is not assigned
Delete T:#?.(v3dp|v3ds) QUIET >NIL:
Assign OGLES2Cache: EXISTS >NIL:
If NOT WARN
  Echo "OGLES2Cache: is assigned: its records are kept; the game's may be loaded from there" >>results/libs.txt
EndIf
Avail FLUSH >NIL:

Stack 9000000
SetEnv SDL_AUDIODRIVER paula
SetEnv OGLES2/LogFile results/ogles2.log
dhewm3 +set fs_basepath "{DATA}" +set s_noSound 0 +set r_fullscreen 1 +set r_mode -1 +set r_customWidth 1280 +set r_customHeight 720 +set com_preloadDemos 1 +timeDemo demo1 usecache quit >results/dhewm3.txt
Echo "exit code $RC" >>results/dhewm3.txt
UnSetEnv OGLES2/LogFile
UnSetEnv SDL_AUDIODRIVER
Copy save/dhewm3log.txt results/dhewm3.log QUIET
List T:#?.(v3dp|v3ds) >results/records.txt
Copy T:#?.(v3dp|v3ds) results/shaders/ QUIET
Avail FLUSH >NIL:
Search results/dhewm3.txt "frames rendered" NONUM
